<section suppressAutoName="true" suppressAutoNumber="true"><title>State variable definition</title>
 
<p>A state variable is one of the variables used to describe the state of a dynamical system. Each state variable corresponds to one of the coordinates of the underlying state space.</p>

<p>An intuitive introduction to the state space is given in <ref to="https://mathinsight.org/dynamical_system_idea">the idea of a dynamical system</ref>.</p>
</section>